# Drive-first documents

If a project file lives on Google Drive, link it (`gdrive.folder_url` / file URL /
frontmatter `gdrive:`). Do not copy SOWs, decks, or spreadsheets into `wiki/` or `raw/`
unless the user explicitly asks for a local copy.
